$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: Chlorination of Heterocycles Standard
Procedure: To a solution of heterocycle (0.1 mmol, 1.0 equiv.) in
chloroform (1.0 mL) at r.t. was added chlorinating reagent (CBMG or NCS,
0.12 mmol, 1.2 equiv.) with stirring. The reaction was monitored by thin
layer chromatography until completion. For substrates, which do not go to
completion in 12 hrs, acetonitrile was employed as the solvent. Upon
consumption of starting material, the reaction was concentrated and
directly purified by column chromatography on silica gel.
4-chloro-1-((2-chlorophenyl)diphenylmethyl)-1H-imidazole (11). Procedure:
Standard procedure was followed using 1.2 equiv. of CBMG in chloroform.
3-oxo-1,3-dihydroisobenzofuran-1-yl
5-chloro-2-((3-(trifluoromethyl)phenyl)amino)nicotinate (28). Standard
procedure was followed using 2.2 equiv. of CBMG in acetonitrile. 28 in
92% yield as a yellow solid. m.p.: 179-182 °C ; R f = 0.45 (25% ethyl
acetate/hexanes); 1H-NMR (500 MHz, CDCl3) δ 10.11 (s, 1H), 8.40 (d, J =
2.6 Hz, 1H), 8.13 (d, J = 2.6 Hz, 1H), 8.05 (s, 1H), 8.02 (d, J = 7.6 Hz,
1H), 7.86-7.79 (m, 2H), 7.76-7.69 (m, 2H), 7.64 (s, 1H), 7.47 (t, J = 7.9
Hz, 1H), 7.36 (d, J = 7.7 Hz, 1H) ppm; 13C-NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ 167.5,
165.4, 154.4, 153.1, 143.7, 139.8, 139.6, 135.3, 131.9, 131.5 (q), 129.5,
126.7, 126.3, 124.2, 123.9, 121.0, 120.2, 120.1, 117.8, 106.3, 93.4 ppm;
IR (neat) ν = 2926, 1792, 1329, 974, 685 cm-1; HRMS (ESI-TOF) calc’d for
C21H13Cl3F3N2O4 + [M+H] 449.0510; found 449.0514.
