$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 1-[3-(4-Bromo-2-methyl-2H-pyrazol-3-yl)-4-methoxyphenyl]-3-(3-chlorophenyl)urea
(14). To a stirred solution of
3-(4-bromo-2-methyl-2H-pyrazol-3-yl)-4-methoxyphenylamine (0.015 g, 0.051
mmol) in methylene chloride (1 mL) was added 3-chlorophenyl isocyanate (7
μL, 0.054 mol). After TLC showed the consumption of the starting
material, the crude material was purified by preparative thin layer
chromatography (TLC) (eluent ethyl acetate/hexane = 1/1) to afford (14)
(0.020 g, 0.047 mmol, 92%) as a colorless solid film.
1-[3-(4-Bromo-2-methyl-2H-pyrazol-3-yl)-4-methoxyphenyl]-3-(3-chlorophenyl)urea
(14), yield 0.020 g, 0.047 mmol, 92% LCMS m/z (%) = 435 (M + H79Br, 68),
437 (M + H81Br, 100). 1H NMR (400 MHz, acetone-d6) δ: 8.29 (s, 1H), 8.19
(s, 1H), 7.80 (t, J=1.9 Hz, 1H), 7.29 (dd, J=2.7, 9.0 Hz, 1H), 7.49 (s,
1H), 7.43 (d, J=2.7 Hz, 1H), 7.34 (d, J=8.4 Hz, 1H), 7.26 (t, J=8.0 Hz,
1H), 7.14 (d, J=9.0 Hz, 1H), 7.00 (d, J=7.8 Hz, 1H), 3.82 (s, 3H), 3.68
(s, 3H).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Discovery of
1-[3-(4-Bromo-2-methyl-2H-pyrazol-3-yl)-4-methoxyphenyl]-3-(2,4-difluorophenyl)urea
(Nelotanserin) and Related 5-Hydroxytryptamine2A Inverse Agonists for the
Treatment of Insomnia
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Teegarden, Bradley R.; Li, Hongmei; Jayakumar, Honnappa; Strah-Pleynet,
Sonja; Dosa, Peter I.; Selaya, Susan D.; Kato, Naomi; Elwell, Katie H.;
