$DATUM 8-(4-butylphenyl)-2,3-bis(decyloxy)-6,10-diiodo-8H-benzo[d]dithieno[3,2-b:2',3'-f]azepine
(6b). To a THF (2 mL) solution of compound 4b (0.157 g, 0.22 mmol) was
added n-BuLi (1.6 M in hexane, 0.290 mL, 0.462 mmol) at -40 ºC. The
mixture was taken out of the cooling bath and allowed to stir at room
temperature for 1 h, at which time the mixture was cooled to -40 ºC again
and iodine (0.123 g, 0.462 mmol) was added to the mixture. After being
allowed to stir at room temperature for 15 h, the mixture was diluted
with diethyl ether and washed with saturated Na2S2O3 (aq) and brine. The
organic layer was dried over MgSO4, evaporated under reduced pressure,
and subjected to column chromatography (chloroform:hexane = 1:3). Yield:
0.191 g (91%) of waxy pale yellow solid. m.p. 63-65 °C. 1H NMR (400 MHz,
CDCl3) δ: 7.21 (s, 2H), 6.95 (pseudo-d, 2H, J = 8.7 Hz), 6.93 (s, 2H),
6.70 (pseudo-d, 2H, J = 8.7 Hz), 4.02 (t, 4H, J = 6.6 Hz), 2.48 (t, 2H, J
= 7.2 Hz), 1.83 (m, 4H), 1.49 (m, 6H), 1.40-1.28 (m, 26H), 0.90 (t, 3H, J
= 7.3 Hz), 0.89 (t, 6H, J = 6.7 Hz). 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ: 149.35,
144.80, 141.75, 141.52, 136.92, 133.92, 129.05, 123.21, 113.11, 112.53,
72.96, 69.49, 34.81, 34.13, 32.13, 29.83, 29.79, 29.57, 29.57, 29.27,
26.17, 22.91, 22.53, 14.36, 14.17. HR-MS (ESI): calcd for C44H59I2NO2S2
[M+H]+, 952.2149; found, 952.2120.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
